WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:07.740
Heroin, Crack Cocaine, Crystal Meth, Krispy
Kreme – these are some of the most addictive

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.219
and most dangerous recreational drugs in the
world.

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:17.470
But there’s an even more dangerous drug,
a substance so terrifying that it would have

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.800
brought David Bowie back down to Earth.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:26.380
Meet Burundanga, also known as Scopolamine
and by its street name “Devil’s Breath”.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.470
Take this and you’ll wake up in a strange
location with your bank account empty and

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.170
all your worldly possessions missing.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:37.890
As has happened to many a victim of this incredibly
powerful drug.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:43.489
Burundanga is not a drug taken recreationally,
in fact it’s a drug that even the most hardcore

00:00:43.489 --> 00:00:47.170
of substance abusers would steer well clear
of.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:51.760
Burundanga is found in the leaves, roots and
seeds of the Borrachero tree.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.370
The most common way to process the drug, ready
for sale on the street, is by taking the seeds

00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:00.409
from the pod and and grinding them and bleaching
them into a white powder.

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:04.030
I know, another white powder, how very original.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:08.540
The tree grows in abundance in Columbia, and
not just in the wilderness, the tree can be

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.530
seen lining the streets of huge cities like
Bogota, even growing in people’s gardens.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:19.180
Although relatively unknown to the rest of
the world, the residents of Columbia know

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.850
all too well about the plant and its dangers.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.430
Columbians make sure they never fall asleep
beneath a Borrachero tree, because it’s

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:33.120
so toxic that even inhaling its scent for
too long is enough to send an individual into

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:37.790
an agonising trip for days and even cause
instant death.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:43.590
There are thousands of urban myths about the
Burundanga drug, and the horrific stories

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:47.300
that have become those who’ve unwittingly
taken the drug.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:52.980
One story documented in a scientific paper
tells of a young man who amputated his own

00:01:52.980 --> 00:02:00.090
tongue and penis after drinking just one cup
of tea made using Burundanga.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.980
The drug basically supresses your free-will
and makes you susceptible to doing absolutely

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.820
anything you are told to.

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:12.099
It’s so effective in fact that it was used
as a truth serum by the CIA; they got a whole

00:02:12.099 --> 00:02:16.609
lot of truth, but they also got a load of
stories about purple elephants and complete

00:02:16.609 --> 00:02:20.370
rubbish as well, because of its powerful hallucinogenic
properties.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:28.390
In Columbia the drug is used for only two
purposes, to rob or to kill.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.159
Often by organised gangs.

00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:34.439
It is common for a gang member to blow the
powder into the face or wipe it across the

00:02:34.439 --> 00:02:37.439
nose and mouth of an unsuspecting member of
the public.

00:02:37.439 --> 00:02:42.319
Within seconds the person is under the drug’s
powerful spell and there’s not a thing they

00:02:42.319 --> 00:02:44.379
can do to stop it.

00:02:44.379 --> 00:02:50.110
Once drugged, the victim looses all self-will
and will happily do whatever the attacker

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:56.440
asks, even if it causes physical or financial
harm to themselves or others.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:01.469
The victim is then told to hand over their
wallet and even to drive to their home and

00:03:01.469 --> 00:03:05.950
help the thieves to empty their own house
of all their most expensive possessions and

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.810
hand them over to the thieves.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:17.209
The worst part about all this is that the
victim isn’t even aware that they’re high,

00:03:17.209 --> 00:03:22.980
so to them it feels completely normal to want
to give away all their money and possessions.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:28.799
And what makes this the perfect criminal drug
is that the victim won’t remember a single

00:03:28.799 --> 00:03:34.370
thing about the incident, not who gave it
to them or what the person made them do.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:38.270
As you might expect it’s also used as a
date-rape drug.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:44.090
However, it’s more commonly used by prostitutes
to rob unsuspecting Johns in clubs.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:49.060
Pimps often supply their prostitutes with
Burundanga and the girls seduce susceptible

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:53.760
looking men in bars, then when they’re not
looking the women spike the victim’s drink

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:54.919
with the drug.

00:03:54.919 --> 00:03:59.309
Within a few minutes of the victim ingesting
the deadly liquour, they will either be dead

00:03:59.309 --> 00:04:06.029
because the dosage was slightly too high,
which happens all too often in Columbia, or

00:04:06.029 --> 00:04:09.209
completely at the mercy of the prostitute’s
every command.

00:04:09.209 --> 00:04:14.560
It’s then common for the women to drive
their victims around town asking the victim

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:20.090
to withdraw all their monies from a series
of ATMs and hand it over, which they gladly

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:24.150
oblige to, because they have lost their ability
to say “no”.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:29.750
And that’s what truly makes this the scariest
drug in the world.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:35.419
Women have also known to have been drugged
with Burundanga and kidnapped, then used as

00:04:35.419 --> 00:04:38.480
prostitutes to earn money for the kidnappers.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:43.389
By keeping the women continuously drugged
for days they won’t put up any resistance

00:04:43.389 --> 00:04:47.979
and are in fact extremely willing to do horrendous
things.

00:04:47.979 --> 00:04:52.580
Burundanga or Scolopamine, as it’s known
clinically, is on the World Health Organization’s

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:58.471
List of Essential Medicines – a list of
the most important medications needed in a

00:04:58.471 --> 00:05:04.030
basic health system, as it’s used in the
medical field in moderate doses to treat motion

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.960
sickness and supress nausea.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:11.050
It’s therefore crazy to think that in a
slightly higher dosage this substance can

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:12.580
be used for evil.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:18.530
But then again, what more would you expect
from Columbia, the drug capital of the western

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:19.530
world.

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:25.169
The bottom line is whether it be Weed, Cocaine
or Scolopamine, don’t do drugs, it’s just

00:05:25.169 --> 00:05:28.160
bloody stupid.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:45.919
Thanks for watching.

